innovating and building parts

00:13:25.659 --> 00:13:26.784
for the future.

00:13:26.784 --> 00:13:29.663
It's just got to be a normal
course of how you think.

00:13:29.663 --> 00:13:33.830
And so we are constantly
thinking about what to do next,

00:13:35.169 --> 00:13:36.503
you know, Android is very popular,

00:13:36.503 --> 00:13:38.361
people are using smartphones,

00:13:38.361 --> 00:13:40.672
but you know I always think
of what is the next version

00:13:40.672 --> 00:13:42.703
of how people use computing, right.

00:13:42.703 --> 00:13:46.063
And so we are thinking about
things like virtual reality,

00:13:46.063 --> 00:13:47.874
or augmented reality, so
these are all new areas

00:13:47.874 --> 00:13:50.255
but we are constantly thinking about it.

00:13:50.255 --> 00:13:52.774
And so you have to do
that on a constant basis

00:13:52.774 --> 00:13:54.807
to push forward.

